WEBVTT

00:01.510 --> 00:04.290
Don't hurt him!

00:05.820 --> 00:07.070
A child?

00:07.070 --> 00:08.420
What's going on?

00:08.960 --> 00:10.810
<i>Okay, this should—</i>

00:10.810 --> 00:12.870
This is no place for children.

00:16.650 --> 00:17.760
<i>He talks?</i>

00:17.760 --> 00:19.920
<i>Must be one of those traditional
long-lived dragons!</i>

00:19.920 --> 00:22.040
<i>Maybe I can reason with him!</i>

00:22.040 --> 00:24.370
You can't hurt them either, 
Mister Fire Dwagon!

00:24.630 --> 00:26.630
They forcibly summon me here,

00:26.630 --> 00:28.880
then approach me with unjust malice.

00:28.880 --> 00:29.830
I cannot brook this.

00:30.090 --> 00:32.300
But it hurts real bad when you fight.

00:32.540 --> 00:36.970
<i>Even with your tough scales, 
if you're doused with powerful water magic...</i>

00:36.970 --> 00:39.730
<i>Wait, scales? I wonder what they feel like...</i>

00:40.030 --> 00:41.930
I wanna give you pats.

00:43.690 --> 00:46.140
You wish to touch me?

00:46.480 --> 00:49.440
Oh, yeah! I wanna give you pats!

00:49.440 --> 00:51.360
You do not fear me?

00:51.640 --> 00:52.810
Nuh-uh!

00:53.530 --> 00:55.160
What a strange child.

00:58.240 --> 00:59.380
The fire dragon!

00:59.740 --> 01:00.790
Prepare to attack!

01:01.050 --> 01:01.920
Halt!

01:13.230 --> 01:14.870
Pat, pat!

01:15.460 --> 01:17.460
Doesn't that feel nice?

01:28.850 --> 01:33.690
<b><i>Fluffy Paradise</i></b>

02:50.270 --> 02:54.900
<b><i>Episode 2   I've Been Summoned</i></b>

02:53.150 --> 02:55.060
I don't believe it...

02:55.320 --> 02:59.020
<i>I thought he might feel hot,
but he's so cool and smooth!</i>

02:59.550 --> 03:03.250
Should you get older and ever need me,

03:03.250 --> 03:05.250
I shall acknowledge you as my master.

03:08.010 --> 03:09.910
No! Don't go bye-bye!

03:10.650 --> 03:12.880
Then I will grant you this.

03:17.630 --> 03:18.830
What is it?

03:19.170 --> 03:22.920
An orb. It connects us.

03:23.860 --> 03:26.020
Keep it with you at all times.

03:26.480 --> 03:29.740
If you so desire, it shall change form.

03:34.270 --> 03:37.810
<i>How am I going to carry 
this around all the time?</i>

03:38.440 --> 03:39.610
<i>Hmm...</i>

03:40.450 --> 03:41.870
I know!

03:48.820 --> 03:51.250
There! That's nice!

03:51.970 --> 03:53.490
You're rather peculiar.

03:55.230 --> 04:00.710
That orb connects the two of us mentally.

04:01.160 --> 04:05.600
You may use my magic through it,

04:05.600 --> 04:07.860
so it will help when you're in danger.

04:08.410 --> 04:09.670
Thank you!

04:10.020 --> 04:12.400
What's your name, Mister Fire Dwagon?

04:13.220 --> 04:15.850
You may call me Sol.

04:16.130 --> 04:18.870
I'm Neema! And...

04:18.870 --> 04:21.310
It's nice to meet you, Sol!

04:22.100 --> 04:23.270
Farewell.

04:34.510 --> 04:35.390
Neema!

04:35.980 --> 04:37.260
Are you hurt?!

04:38.180 --> 04:39.470
Nope! I'm fine!

04:39.840 --> 04:41.820
C-Can't bweathe...

04:41.280 --> 04:44.430
Oh, I was so worried!

04:44.860 --> 04:46.520
Neema!

04:45.170 --> 04:47.400
Honestly, you're so...

04:48.530 --> 04:50.350
<i>This again?!</i>

04:50.680 --> 04:53.050
Well, I'm glad you're safe.

04:53.870 --> 04:57.310
<i>Maybe the Brute Prince was worried 
about me in his own weird way.</i>

04:57.650 --> 05:02.180
Duke Osphe, have the court mages 
look into this matter.

05:02.180 --> 05:03.100
Yes, Your Highness.

05:03.100 --> 05:04.040
And...

05:05.170 --> 05:07.560
I'm sure the palace will want <i>her</i>.

05:07.560 --> 05:09.000
I trust you to find a solution.

05:11.360 --> 05:13.910
To even think of those power-hungry fiends

05:13.910 --> 05:16.280
setting their greedy eyes
 on my precious Neema...

05:16.280 --> 05:19.540
Hmm, maybe I'll just kill them all.

05:19.540 --> 05:24.310
<i>Is it just me... 
or has this turned into a huge ordeal?</i>

05:37.420 --> 05:40.120
Presenting the prime minister, 
Duke Dayland Osphe!

05:40.860 --> 05:44.170
And the head of the Royal Magic Research 
Center's Engineering Department,

05:44.170 --> 05:46.460
Duchess Cerulia Osphe!

05:46.830 --> 05:50.580
They have arrived along with their 
youngest daughter, Lady Nefertima!

05:54.420 --> 05:57.220
<i>There are </i>so<i> many important-looking people!</i>

05:57.890 --> 05:59.670
I'm sorry for summoning you like this.

06:00.010 --> 06:03.630
I'd like to discuss the events at the academy
concerning the fire dragon.

06:04.790 --> 06:08.670
I was informed that Nefertima 
formed a pact with the beast.

06:08.670 --> 06:09.600
Is this true?

06:09.600 --> 06:12.040
<i>I guess we're not beating around the bush!</i>

06:14.310 --> 06:16.780
It is not a formal pact.

06:16.780 --> 06:20.740
But your daughter is able to use the 
fire dragon's powers, is she not?

06:21.020 --> 06:24.690
Yes, I'm sure that he will aid her
 if she so desires it.

06:24.690 --> 06:28.070
But she did not receive
 the holy beast's blessing.

06:28.070 --> 06:30.920
<i>The holy beast's blessing? What's that?</i>

06:31.620 --> 06:35.620
So she will not use the fire dragon's 
powers to threaten our kingdom?

06:36.090 --> 06:39.730
She will not. I, Dayland Osphe, 
swear it upon my name.

06:41.470 --> 06:43.180
<i>A True Name Vow?!</i>

06:43.180 --> 06:45.040
<i>If he breaks that, he'll die.</i>

06:45.040 --> 06:47.180
<i>It's the strongest oath you can swear here.</i>

06:47.490 --> 06:51.360
I believe you. Now, have we figured out 
the cause of what happened?

06:51.360 --> 06:53.630
Allow me to explain.

06:53.890 --> 06:58.100
Royal Magical Research Center
Director Salzar

06:54.060 --> 06:58.110
There are no doubts
 about the summoning circle used.

06:58.460 --> 07:02.550
There were protections in place in case 
the spellcaster said the wrong incantation.

07:02.550 --> 07:06.320
Therefore, the dragon would not
have appeared with an incorrect chant.

07:06.320 --> 07:09.180
So the spellcaster was not at fault.

07:09.180 --> 07:10.040
Indeed.

07:10.350 --> 07:14.240
Then how do you explain
the dragon's appearance?

07:14.820 --> 07:16.860
Perhaps it was a supernatural force...

07:16.860 --> 07:19.000
Perhaps it was the will of God.

07:19.230 --> 07:20.700
God?!

07:21.360 --> 07:23.060
<i>That guy </i>again<i>?!</i>

07:23.060 --> 07:23.920
<i>He totally would!</i>

07:23.920 --> 07:27.180
<i>Probably to make me interact with the 
beings of this world or something!</i>

07:28.130 --> 07:29.590
I see...

07:29.900 --> 07:32.090
What say you, High Priest?

07:32.540 --> 07:33.930
Sire.

07:34.230 --> 07:39.020
I believe it was the will 
of the God of Divine Creation.

07:34.260 --> 07:39.020
Church of Divine Creation
 Gaché Kingdom's High Priest

07:39.450 --> 07:41.560
Holy beasts are present in our land

07:41.560 --> 07:44.730
because he expects great 
things of you, Your Majesty.

07:45.170 --> 07:48.190
It is his hope you will usher in
 an era of tranquility

07:48.190 --> 07:50.650
in which we humans rule supreme.

07:52.680 --> 07:57.400
<i>Aha... Are these guys part of what
God was talking about?</i>

07:57.730 --> 08:00.710
<i>Is this the typical pattern where 
they brainwash people</i>

08:00.710 --> 08:03.880
<i>with a "divine" message
 while butting into politics?</i>

08:04.680 --> 08:07.540
<i>Still, I shouldn't be so quick to judge.</i>

08:07.540 --> 08:11.470
<i>I'm sure I'll have until I die to decide.</i>

08:11.470 --> 08:16.190
<i>And my top priority is wellness
fueled by all the fluffy things!</i>

08:17.330 --> 08:18.580
Bored already?

08:19.170 --> 08:20.800
<i>Was he watching me this whole time?</i>

08:21.030 --> 08:24.560
<i>And he has the nerve to mock me?!
 Curse you, Brute Prince!</i>

08:25.020 --> 08:28.090
If you're bored, would you like
 to go play with Lars?

08:28.790 --> 08:32.270
Yes, this must be a rather difficult 
conversation for Nefertima to follow.

08:32.760 --> 08:34.030
Go ahead and play.

08:34.510 --> 08:35.610
<i>Yay!</i>

08:35.610 --> 08:36.470
Lars.

08:40.320 --> 08:43.080
<i>Now it's time to floof
 and pat Lars all I want!</i>

08:49.010 --> 08:51.180
<i>So... So cute!</i>

08:51.410 --> 08:52.790
Lars!

09:00.400 --> 09:02.510
We can play here?

09:03.430 --> 09:05.890
<i>Are these slabs of meat for Lars?</i>

09:13.760 --> 09:16.990
Lars, say, "Aah..."

09:23.550 --> 09:26.530
<i>He totally just looks like 
any ol' kitty right now!</i>

09:26.530 --> 09:28.280
Did she just feed it barehanded?!

09:29.200 --> 09:30.040
Oh?

09:30.040 --> 09:32.470
Lady Nefertima, here you go.

09:33.080 --> 09:34.740
Thanks!

09:36.560 --> 09:39.170
I-I'm not worthy, my lady!

09:40.790 --> 09:42.900
I wonder what that was about.

09:42.900 --> 09:44.120
<i>Well, whatever.</i>

09:44.120 --> 09:47.570
<i>I'm gonna enjoy all the floofing 
time I can right now!</i>

09:49.780 --> 09:51.530
That tickles!

10:03.830 --> 10:08.030
Oh, Neema... How can you be
 so cute when you snooze?

10:10.880 --> 10:12.000
And yet...

10:12.000 --> 10:13.760
She's fast asleep next to a sky tiger!

10:13.760 --> 10:15.460
She really is no ordinary girl!

10:15.460 --> 10:18.010
<i>Thank goodness Lars helped 
her fall fast asleep.</i>

10:18.380 --> 10:21.390
The fire dragon will bring 
great fortune to our land!

10:21.390 --> 10:23.640
Yes. Of course it'll help the people,

10:23.640 --> 10:25.730
but also prove a great boon in battle.

10:25.730 --> 10:29.240
We should definitely have 
her form a formal pact.

10:29.240 --> 10:33.930
But then we'd have to keep 
Lady Nefertima under our supervision.

10:34.350 --> 10:38.540
<i>I hope she never hears 
such selfish blathering.</i>

10:39.130 --> 10:42.410
<i>Now then... How are we going 
to get out of this situation?</i>

10:42.410 --> 10:44.360
Is Neema all right?

10:44.620 --> 10:47.960
Minister of Internal Affairs
 Olive Wise

10:44.660 --> 10:47.950
Has not having magical powers 
affected her physically?

10:47.950 --> 10:49.790
Not yet.

10:49.790 --> 10:53.920
I wonder if the sky tiger's attachment to her
is also because of the dragon.

10:54.320 --> 10:57.140
Perhaps we should assign Neema
 a personal guard.

10:57.380 --> 11:02.090
Head of the Royal Knighthood and Royal Guard
General Gouche Zelnan

10:57.390 --> 11:00.500
There's a chance her life may be in danger.

11:00.500 --> 11:03.150
Let me know if I may be of assistance.

11:03.150 --> 11:07.550
A most reassuring offer. 
There's just so much we don't know yet.

11:07.550 --> 11:10.790
I'd be much obliged for your help, General.

11:11.290 --> 11:13.750
<i>That's a founding hero for you.</i>

11:13.750 --> 11:15.430
Duke Osphe.

11:15.430 --> 11:17.570
I would be honored if you let the Church

11:17.570 --> 11:19.480
look after your precious daughter...

11:20.350 --> 11:25.950
We have experience educating 
holy maidens, after all.

11:26.230 --> 11:29.590
Oh, no. That wouldn't suit our Neema...

11:29.590 --> 11:30.840
<i>Or rather,</i>

11:30.840 --> 11:35.090
<i>the Church of Divine Creation's
so-called "education" is just indoctrination.</i>

11:35.090 --> 11:39.350
<i>What gives you the right to call girls
forced into playing puppets "holy maidens"?</i>

11:39.840 --> 11:42.430
If you leave Lady Nefertima in our hands,

11:42.430 --> 11:45.500
I promise you she will grow 
into a fine holy maiden.

11:48.370 --> 11:49.950
I do beg your pardon,

11:49.950 --> 11:55.100
but she's so loved by all creatures 
because she is innocent and carefree.

11:55.720 --> 11:59.120
If we give her to you
 and she becomes no more than a doll,

11:59.120 --> 12:02.950
I highly doubt the fire dragon and 
His Highness's holy beast would approve.

12:04.270 --> 12:07.900
A doll...? I won't stand for such insult.

12:10.810 --> 12:15.960
A-And I beg your pardon, but is Lady 
Nefertima even <i>your</i> daughter?

12:15.960 --> 12:18.910
Why— And what do you mean by that?

12:18.910 --> 12:23.500
Oh, nothing.
 I just thought I'd heard otherwise.

12:23.500 --> 12:25.720
Still, I must say...

12:26.030 --> 12:30.420
She doesn't bear much of a resemblance 
to your other two children.

12:31.690 --> 12:32.630
Gracious.

12:32.630 --> 12:35.840
My husband and I have exchanged 
the True Name Vow.

12:36.310 --> 12:39.020
If broken, we'd face divine wrath

12:39.020 --> 12:40.950
and bear the mark of the fallen our foreheads.

12:41.250 --> 12:43.540
Good sir, do you see it on mine?

12:44.940 --> 12:48.250
Well, it's well known how much 
the duke fancies you, my lady...

12:48.540 --> 12:52.200
But perhaps only Duke Osphe 
took the True Name Vow.

12:52.480 --> 12:56.080
His Majesty was present when 
we exchanged our vows.

12:56.080 --> 12:58.600
You'd cast doubt upon the king, too?

13:01.860 --> 13:05.850
But truly, if we are to think 
of Lady Nefertima's future,

13:05.850 --> 13:07.790
I agree with the High Priest.

13:06.370 --> 13:07.790
<i>In the end,</i>

13:07.790 --> 13:12.510
<i>with the help of my wife, her mentor, Salzar,
 and her fellow mentee, the king,</i>

13:12.510 --> 13:16.000
<i>we were able to shut down
 those who opposed us.</i>

13:31.660 --> 13:33.240
Lars?

13:33.560 --> 13:35.470
The meeting is over.

13:35.470 --> 13:37.500
Papa, Mama...

13:37.500 --> 13:39.200
No one's in trouble.

13:39.490 --> 13:42.660
Really? So no one's gonna yell at me? 
Nothing scawy will happen?

13:42.890 --> 13:46.850
That's right. Because your power
appears to be the will of God.

13:47.510 --> 13:48.800
Nefertima.

13:49.040 --> 13:50.310
Mister King!

13:51.450 --> 13:54.610
From now on, you may go anywhere 
you'd like in the palace,

13:54.880 --> 13:57.310
though you'll need supervision
 in certain areas.

13:57.580 --> 13:58.920
Really?!

13:58.920 --> 14:01.480
Yes. You like animals, don't you?

14:01.480 --> 14:02.280
Yes!

14:02.720 --> 14:06.500
There are plenty of animals
 you're bound to like in the palace.

14:06.790 --> 14:07.700
Huh?

14:08.780 --> 14:10.380
For example...

14:14.670 --> 14:16.790
Why don't you calm down a bit?

14:16.790 --> 14:19.270
Huh?! B-But...

14:20.000 --> 14:21.820
They're here. You may enter.

14:23.640 --> 14:28.170
Gwynn Fields of the second 
brigade of the royal guard...

14:28.910 --> 14:30.350
At your service.

14:31.560 --> 14:34.310
<i>Wow, he's so pretty!</i>

14:34.310 --> 14:38.870
At ease. This is Duke Osphe's
 daughter, Nefertima.

14:39.540 --> 14:41.940
Pleased to meet you, my lady.

14:43.080 --> 14:46.810
I'm Dayland Osphe's second daughter, Nefertima.

14:47.240 --> 14:50.740
I saw you before in the throne room!

14:51.940 --> 14:56.030
Neema, if anything ever happens
 in the palace, you can rely on Gwynn.

14:56.030 --> 14:56.940
Okay!

14:56.940 --> 14:59.240
Nice to meet you, Gwynn!

14:59.240 --> 15:01.670
The pleasure is all mine.

15:01.890 --> 15:04.020
I have a favor to ask today.

15:04.960 --> 15:07.490
Take Neema to the dragon stables.

15:07.490 --> 15:09.220
Par... don?

15:15.870 --> 15:17.490
Why must I do this?

15:17.490 --> 15:20.030
And why take her to the stables where <i>he</i> is?

15:21.760 --> 15:23.850
<i>You're thinking out loud there, dude.</i>

15:24.220 --> 15:28.670
<i>Though I'm sure the last thing 
a brigade leader wants to do is babysit.</i>

15:29.150 --> 15:30.660
<i>But more importantly,</i>

15:30.660 --> 15:34.580
<i>today, I want to give some actual fantasy 
world dragons all of the head pats!</i>

15:34.970 --> 15:37.530
<i>And for that, I need you 
to tag along with me...</i>

15:38.480 --> 15:40.190
Oh, there you are.

15:41.520 --> 15:43.200
His Highness filled me in.

15:43.590 --> 15:46.410
Is this the little lady who wants 
to see the stables?

15:50.200 --> 15:52.980
<i>He actually stooped down to make
eye contact with a child.</i>

15:52.980 --> 15:55.840
<i>That's really rare in this world. 
He must be a nice guy!</i>

15:55.840 --> 15:59.360
I'm Dayland Osphe's second daughter, Nefertima.

15:59.710 --> 16:01.590
Look at you! So prim at your age.

16:03.060 --> 16:06.270
Nice to meet ya! I'm the captain 
of the dragon knights, Dan Yates!

16:06.270 --> 16:07.270
Good to have you.

16:07.920 --> 16:10.500
My, I see you never change.

16:10.500 --> 16:11.450
Huh?

16:11.450 --> 16:12.800
At the palace,

16:12.800 --> 16:14.840
you could run into a superior anytime.

16:14.840 --> 16:16.560
You should dress accordingly.

16:16.560 --> 16:19.700
When you're tending to dragons, 
you need to prioritize mobility.

16:23.900 --> 16:25.380
<i>Wh-What the...?</i>

16:25.690 --> 16:27.340
There they go again.

16:27.610 --> 16:31.030
They were in the same class 
at the royal academy.

16:31.030 --> 16:34.170
They've apparently been competing 
with each other ever since.

16:34.430 --> 16:37.150
You sure that's not just 
an excuse to play around?

16:37.400 --> 16:39.510
Playing around with dragons is my job.

16:39.510 --> 16:41.840
You can't even ride them 
if they don't like you.

16:41.840 --> 16:43.080
You know that!

16:43.440 --> 16:46.500
Well, if you're working, 
then clean up properly.

16:46.500 --> 16:48.560
It always reeks of animal stench here.

16:48.560 --> 16:49.940
What'd you say?

16:49.940 --> 16:53.110
<i>Oh, come on! What am I even here for?!</i>

16:53.550 --> 16:56.820
Hey, hey! Can I see the dwagons now?

16:57.250 --> 17:01.010
Oh, yes. Sorry about that. Right this way.

17:02.080 --> 17:03.590
You can only look though, okay?

17:03.590 --> 17:05.470
Stick your hand out and they'll eat ya.

17:05.470 --> 17:06.200
Okay!

17:22.220 --> 17:24.590
The smaller flying dragons are lindblooms.

17:24.590 --> 17:28.770
And those without wings are a subspecies
 of earth dragon called lindrakes.

17:29.030 --> 17:31.100
We're currently in the grasslands,

17:31.100 --> 17:34.500
but we also have desert, 
forest, and lake areas.

17:34.500 --> 17:36.480
Wow! This place is so big!

17:36.480 --> 17:38.380
It's all maintained with magic,

17:38.380 --> 17:41.440
so the deserts are actually hot, 
and the forests are cool.

17:41.750 --> 17:43.220
They don't run away?

17:43.220 --> 17:46.230
They're bound by their true names, 
so there's no need to worry.

17:48.460 --> 17:50.220
They're so cute.

17:52.490 --> 17:53.440
Right?

17:54.810 --> 17:58.260
<i>Dan must really love dragons.</i>

17:59.280 --> 18:01.520
<i>I wanna give them head pats...</i>

18:01.930 --> 18:04.480
<i>But he'll probably say no if I ask.</i>

18:04.750 --> 18:06.980
<i>I wonder how I can touch them...</i>

18:07.460 --> 18:09.940
Mmgh...

18:23.760 --> 18:24.790
This way!

18:32.980 --> 18:34.870
<i>No! They're gonna get her!</i>

18:35.250 --> 18:36.460
Lady Nefertima!

18:39.240 --> 18:41.480
Your name is Ghizel?

18:42.430 --> 18:44.270
My name is Neema.

18:45.600 --> 18:48.260
Yup. I have Sol's orb.

18:48.600 --> 18:51.080
Ghizel, can I give you head pats?

18:55.830 --> 18:58.670
Mister Dan, can I play with them?

18:59.180 --> 19:00.630
S-Sure...

19:00.910 --> 19:02.480
Yay!

19:09.740 --> 19:11.090
Okay!

19:14.560 --> 19:16.470
See you later!

19:19.920 --> 19:22.370
Wow! This feels great!

19:23.420 --> 19:24.860
<i>Human child.</i>

19:25.850 --> 19:28.680
<i>I sense the fire dragon's presence in you,</i>

19:28.680 --> 19:30.630
<i>yet you have no pact with him, do you?</i>

19:30.630 --> 19:32.050
Nuh-uh. Guess not.

19:32.350 --> 19:35.110
I heard Sol's voice from the orb earlier.

19:35.110 --> 19:39.020
He said that if I have the orb, 
I can talk to all the dragons.

19:39.340 --> 19:44.240
<i>Yes. Our pack shall welcome 
you as a dragon maiden.</i>

19:57.740 --> 19:59.490
<i>Yummy!</i>

19:59.490 --> 20:01.140
H-Hey!

20:01.660 --> 20:02.920
Come back here!

20:03.220 --> 20:05.280
<i>Wait, are we playing tag?</i>

20:05.280 --> 20:06.340
<i>I wanna play, too!</i>

20:15.140 --> 20:17.180
This feels so nice.

20:22.900 --> 20:23.620
Take that!

20:32.490 --> 20:34.000
Counterattack!

20:40.070 --> 20:42.470
The one whose name Lady Nefertima guessed,

20:42.470 --> 20:44.340
Ghizel, is that pack's leader.

20:44.680 --> 20:48.310
He's extremely proud and won't 
let anyone onto his back.

20:48.310 --> 20:52.300
So what the heck's going on? He was 
so calm around Lady Nefertima.

20:52.300 --> 20:54.260
Man, I'm never gonna get over this!

20:54.970 --> 20:57.270
You heard about the fire dragon, didn't you?

20:57.270 --> 20:58.190
Yeah.

20:58.190 --> 21:01.170
He was summoned during
 an exam at the academy, right?

21:01.170 --> 21:04.930
I could see him flying back to 
the northern mountains from here.

21:05.300 --> 21:07.780
I wish we could've been there, though!

21:08.010 --> 21:11.260
I heard there was some girl who formed 
a pact with the fire dragon, too...

21:11.260 --> 21:15.990
Wait. Didn't Lady Nefertima 
mention something about an orb?

21:17.480 --> 21:20.930
It's a legendary magical item that allows 
you to communicate with dragons.

21:20.930 --> 21:25.680
If she's in possession of an artifact
that only primordial dragons can create...

21:25.900 --> 21:29.930
Lady Nefertima is now said to be
 the fire dragon's master.

21:29.930 --> 21:31.120
I knew it!

21:31.450 --> 21:34.880
Except they haven't formed a formal pact.

21:35.120 --> 21:38.090
Still, a little girl like her?
 I can't believe it.

21:38.310 --> 21:41.500
I wasn't convinced myself, but...

21:41.500 --> 21:42.950
I'm back!

21:45.940 --> 21:47.530
Why is Sir Lars here?!

21:49.470 --> 21:51.480
He came to pick me up!

21:51.870 --> 21:56.490
She commands His Highness's holy beast
 as well as the lindblooms and lindrakes...

21:56.800 --> 21:59.750
Just who is this little girl?

21:59.750 --> 22:04.110
I got to give lots of head pats 
and floofings! It was so much fun!

23:35.180 --> 23:40.010
<b>Next Time</b>

23:35.180 --> 23:40.010
<b>A Lovely Gift</b>
